  "revision": "Rev. 13, July 2025",
  "pages": 11
 },
 "summary": "Two-terminal bandgap voltage reference diodes, 1.235 V or 2.500 V, operating from 10 µA to 20 mA of reverse current. On-chip trimming sets initial tolerance grades of 1.0 % to 3.0 %; dynamic impedance is 0.6 Ω typ and average temperature coefficient 80 ppm/°C typ. The LM285 is rated −40 °C to +85 °C, the LM385 and LM385B 0 °C to +70 °C; the active parts are SOIC-8 and the TO-92 parts are discontinued. LM285D-2.5R2G is the 2.500 V, −40 °C to +85 °C part in SOIC-8 on 2500-piece tape and reel.",
